  "steps": [
    "Add the water, melted butter, pudding mix, warm milk, egg, sugar, salt, bread flour, and yeast to the bread machine pan. Run the Dough cycle.",
    "Roll the dough into a 17x10-inch rectangle on a lightly floured surface. Beat the softened butter, brown sugar, and cinnamon together and spread it over the dough. Sprinkle with pecans.",
    "Roll up from the long side and slice into 16 rolls. Place in a buttered 9x13 pan, cover, and let rise until doubled, about 45 minutes.",
    "Bake at 350°F for 15-20 minutes, until golden.",
    "Beat the cream cheese and butter, then the powdered sugar, vanilla, and salt. Thin with milk as needed and spread over the warm rolls."
  ]
